Cell["\<\
For integer shifts j,k, f0(x+j,x+k)/f0(x,x) is shiftRatio[j,k,x]. Applying \
this recurrence before FullSimplify reduces the loop algebra to rational \
functions. Define G = f0(-I nu,-I nu), and express all loop factors below in \
units of G.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7b6016c9-5ae8-644f-a6f7-e16582b439a5"],

