Cell["\<\
The original Laurent finite-part expressions have been reduced by \
lower-parameter permutation symmetry, Gauss summation of 2F1(1), and \
Gamma/polygamma recurrence and reflection identities. A parameter derivative \
is reduced with Gauss only when an untouched equal upper/lower parameter \
cancels in an open neighborhood of the differentiation point. Three parameter \
derivatives remain exact in the displayed basis; they have not been discarded.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b56fc2c2-df8f-3a44-a0d3-48d53c28cc38"],

