Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Analytic extraction from regulated P2", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"3e0ea1ea-efaf-ea47-91ac-caea70f945f7"],

Cell["\<\
The imported finite-part routine expands P2L and P2PM, extracts the \
regulator-zero Laurent finite coefficient, and defines P2LReg0 and P2PMReg0. \
The following Simplify cells display those exact analytic results.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3fb9cc17-d589-3b40-bea5-d73ec436bc55"],

